Answers

CI/CD - Pipeline 
1. Setup slack or email integration with your pipeline so that it can give an exact error to the developer and DevOps.
2. Setup cache in your pipeline, also you need to make sure each stage  should export some artifact so that if the pipeline fails in some stage you need not run from start.

Infrastructure as a code
1. You need to make the provider block dynamic like value should be picked from the environment variable, and should have different tfvars for prod environment or might be issue with permission.
2. Use Terraform lifecycle block/ or sentinel policy check

Monitoring and observability 
1. Enable synethic monitoring or integrating pager duty with the system
2. Lack of SLO or runbook etc missing 

Containerization and kubernetes 
1. We can use Keda for pod level scaling and karpenter for node level scaling will select spot or on-demand based on rule and environment 
2. Depends what error you are getting, I will do describe pod to check the actual error 

Security and access control 
1. I will create a group and add developer to that group then I will attach the policy to that group or RBAC
2. I will configure the pre-commit hook to scan the secret before commit.


Collaboration and culture 
1. I prefer to take the developer in the call for solving the issue, daily standup and documentation 

2. Will create some sort of runbook or issue list in the conference page which tells you how to fix known issue.
